# Left unset on purpose: the app calls the API on whatever host the page
# itself was loaded from (see src/lib/api.ts) so it works from any of the
# LAN links (IP, hostname) without the session cookie breaking. Only set
# this if the API is genuinely served from a different host than the page.
# VITE_API_URL=http://192.168.72.139:4000
